# Paths are relative to the build context (the parent folder of both repos).
# Without this file, Docker would upload emberkv/target (gigabytes of Rust builds).
**
!erp/
!emberkv/sdk/typescript/
erp/node_modules
erp/.next
erp/.dev
erp/.env*
erp/test-results
erp/playwright-report
emberkv/sdk/typescript/node_modules
